DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     AMD cryptographic co-processor devices provide offload for various cryp‐
     tographic algorithms, offload of zlib compression and decompression, and
     a random number generator.

     The ccccpp driver supports feeding output of the random number generator
     into the kernel entropy pool.

